! style="width:50%;" |Task
! style="width:50%;" |Requirements 
|-
|1. Create a [[super combat potion]] in [[Varrock west bank]].
|
*{{SCP|Quest}} Completion of [[Druidic Ritual]]
*{{SCP|Herblore|90|link=y}}
*[[Super attack (4)]], [[super strength (4)]], [[super defence (4)]], and a [[torstol]]
|-
|2. Use [[Lunar magic]] to make 20 [[mahogany plank]]s at the [[Lumberyard]].
''Note: You must stand within the [[Lumber Yard]], past the fence.''
|
*{{SCP|Quest}} Completion of [[Dream Mentor]]
*{{SCP|Magic|86|link=y}}
*[[Lunar spellbook]] selected
*21,000 [[coins]] and 20 [[mahogany logs]]{{efn|name=voucher|You may use ten [[sawmill voucher]]s to halve the required items and runes for the [[Plank Make]] task.}}
*Means to cast [[Plank Make]] twenty times ({{RuneReq|Nature=20|Astral=40|Earth=300}}){{efn|name=voucher}}
|-
|3. Bake a [[summer pie]] in the [[Cooks' Guild|Cooking Guild]].
''Note: Instead of using a [[range]], you can use the [[Bake Pie]] spell to prevent burning the pie.
|
*{{SCP|Cooking|95|link=y}}
*[[Raw summer pie]]
*[[Chef's hat]], [[golden chef's hat]], [[Varrock armour 3]], or [[Cooking cape]]
|-
|4. Smith and fletch ten [[rune dart]]s within [[Varrock]].
|
*{{SCP|Quest}} Completion of [[The Tourist Trap]]
*{{SCP|Smithing|89|link=y}} and {{SCP|Fletching|81|link=y}}
*[[Runite bar]], 10 [[feather]]s and a [[hammer]]
|-
|5. Craft 100 or more [[earth runes]] simultaneously from Essence without the use of [[Runic extract|Extracts]].
|
*{{SCP|Runecraft|78|link=y}}
*{{SCP|Runecraft|52|link=y}} with 2+ [[Raiments of the Eye]] pieces
*28 [[Pure essence|pure]], [[Daeyalt essence|daeyalt]], or [[rune essence]] (fewer may suffice with more [[Raiments of the Eye]] pieces)
*Access to the [[Earth Altar]] ([[earth talisman]]/[[Earth tiara|tiara]], [[elemental talisman]]/[[Elemental tiara|tiara]], or the [[Abyss]])
|}
{{Notelist}}

===Rewards=== 
*[[Varrock armour 4]]:
**Can be worn in place of a [[prospector jacket]] for [[clue step]]s and the experience bonus (also provides the set bonus when worn with rest of the [[Prospector kit|full outfit]])
**While worn, 10% chance of mining double of any [[ore]], as well as [[Mining enhancers#List of affected rocks|various other minerals]] (experience granted for both minerals)
**While worn, 10% chance of smelting 2 [[bar]]s at once, of any kind, when using the [[Edgeville furnace]] (experience granted for both bars)
*[[Antique lamp (elite)|Antique lamp]] worth 50,000 experience in any skill of at least level 70
*[[Zaff]] will sell you 120 [[bank note|noted]] [[Battlestaff|battlestaves]] as a single stack every day for 840,000 [[coins]], resellable on the [[Grand Exchange]] for a profit of {{NoCoins|{{GEPT|Battlestaff|120}}-840000}} [[coins]] (after tax)<ref name="WhyWasThisInTheLead"/>
*The [[skull sceptre]] will now hold up to 26 [[Skull_sceptre#Using_the_Sceptre|charges]], up from 22
*Individual parts used to make the [[skull sceptre]] now give four extra [[Bone fragments|bone fragments]] per component when chiselled

